    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on the ultimate intergalactic adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash-landed on a mysterious tropical island, you find yourself in the heart of <strong>Lost World</strong>\u2014a place teeming with secrets, challenges, and hidden treasures. Your mission? To uncover the <strong>Loops</strong> that will unlock the gateway to the <strong>Space HUB</strong>, a vast interdimensional nexus connecting <strong>a lot of worlds</strong>\u2014each with its own unique theme, challenges, and lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A quest for the legendary Golden Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In eWorlds, every step you take is part of an epic quest to find the legendary <strong>Golden Loop</strong>. But this journey isn\u2019t for the faint of heart: each world you explore brings its own set of <strong>puzzles</strong> to solve, <strong>traps</strong> to dodge, and <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel. Whether you\u2019re racing against the clock in thrilling time trials or simply soaking in the diverse landscapes, every moment is packed with excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectathon enthusiasts</strong>, rejoice! eWorlds is a love letter to the <strong>classic platformers</strong> that captivated our hearts. As you delve into each world, you'll find exciting new ways to interact with the environment, revealing <strong>hidden</strong> paths and <strong>secrets</strong> that were once out of reach. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-ups: your key to mastering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>powerful Power-Ups</strong> to tackle the game\u2019s challenges! Smash through barriers with the <strong>Hammer</strong>, soar through the skies with the <strong>Umbrella</strong>, or use the <strong>Grappling Hook</strong> to navigate treacherous terrain. These <strong>Power-Ups</strong> aren\u2019t just upgrades\u2014they\u2019re essential tools for overcoming obstacles and discovering every <strong>Loop</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the adventure doesn\u2019t have to be a solo one. eWorlds lets you share the journey with friends in <strong>cooperative play</strong>. Team up to tackle the multiverse\u2019s toughest challenges, strategize to collect every <strong>Loop</strong>, and uncover secrets that might just be impossible to find on your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you traverse these worlds, don\u2019t forget to <strong>collect coins</strong> scattered throughout your journey. These coins can be spent in the in-game store, where you\u2019ll find an array of <strong>skins</strong> to <strong>customize</strong> your character. Mix and match to create a look that\u2019s uniquely yours, and show off your style as you explore the <strong>multiverse</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in eWorlds:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectathon glory:</strong>: Gather Loops in each world and unlock the path to the ultimate prize\u2014the legendary Golden Loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse worlds:</strong> From the tropical mysteries of Lost World to the futuristic landscapes of Alienware Station, each world is distinct and packed with surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time trials &amp; Challenges:</strong> Push your skills to the limit in thrilling time trials and face a variety of challenges designed to test your wits and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups:</strong> Discover and equip powerful items that give you new abilities, making you stronger and more versatile as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative play:</strong> Share the adventure with friends, combining your strengths to overcome the most formidable obstacles and unlock every secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Worlds:</strong> Explore and conquer each world to unlock the next, uncovering the mysteries of the multiverse one Loop at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Collect coins across different worlds and use them in the store to get a variety of skins. Mix and match to show off your unique style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/9411d90fc4394a90c69af77a40cc70a4.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/9411d90fc4394a90c69af77a40cc70a4.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/9411d90fc4394a90c69af77a40cc70a4.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Important note:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We will only be providing support in English and Spanish, but we have automatically translated the game into other languages to enhance the experience for everyone (French, German, Portuguese, Polish, Russian, Korean, Chinese, Traditional Chinese and Japanese). However, please keep in mind that this is not a professional translation and may contain errors.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/5c82c80b14c4d4eb41a1a7a39f24d8ac.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on the ultimate intergalactic adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash-landed on a mysterious tropical island, you find yourself in the heart of <strong>Lost World</strong>\u2014a place teeming with secrets, challenges, and hidden treasures. Your mission? To uncover the <strong>Loops</strong> that will unlock the gateway to the <strong>Space HUB</strong>, a vast interdimensional nexus connecting <strong>a lot of worlds</strong>\u2014each with its own unique theme, challenges, and lore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/55a7c8c978ef06019ed5869998940955.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A quest for the legendary Golden Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In eWorlds, every step you take is part of an epic quest to find the legendary <strong>Golden Loop</strong>. But this journey isn\u2019t for the faint of heart: each world you explore brings its own set of <strong>puzzles</strong> to solve, <strong>traps</strong> to dodge, and <strong>mysteries</strong> to unravel. Whether you\u2019re racing against the clock in thrilling time trials or simply soaking in the diverse landscapes, every moment is packed with excitement. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectathon enthusiasts</strong>, rejoice! eWorlds is a love letter to the <strong>classic platformers</strong> that captivated our hearts. As you delve into each world, you'll find exciting new ways to interact with the environment, revealing <strong>hidden</strong> paths and <strong>secrets</strong> that were once out of reach. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-ups: your key to mastering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>powerful Power-Ups</strong> to tackle the game\u2019s challenges! Smash through barriers with the <strong>Hammer</strong>, soar through the skies with the <strong>Umbrella</strong>, or use the <strong>Grappling Hook</strong> to navigate treacherous terrain. These <strong>Power-Ups</strong> aren\u2019t just upgrades\u2014they\u2019re essential tools for overcoming obstacles and discovering every <strong>Loop</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/0c6ecec0f68a0ea18d65404fc842da6d.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the adventure doesn\u2019t have to be a solo one. eWorlds lets you share the journey with friends in <strong>cooperative play</strong>. Team up to tackle the multiverse\u2019s toughest challenges, strategize to collect every <strong>Loop</strong>, and uncover secrets that might just be impossible to find on your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/46850a0e32497c4417b95f938b8ad55a.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you traverse these worlds, don\u2019t forget to <strong>collect coins</strong> scattered throughout your journey. These coins can be spent in the in-game store, where you\u2019ll find an array of <strong>skins</strong> to <strong>customize</strong> your character. Mix and match to create a look that\u2019s uniquely yours, and show off your style as you explore the <strong>multiverse</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.webm?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/856216ed1792db7af56240785f0358f3.mp4?t=1743429636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you in eWorlds:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectathon glory:</strong>: Gather Loops in each world and unlock the path to the ultimate prize\u2014the legendary Golden Loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse worlds:</strong> From the tropical mysteries of Lost World to the futuristic landscapes of Alienware Station, each world is distinct and packed with surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time trials &amp; Challenges:</strong> Push your skills to the limit in thrilling time trials and face a variety of challenges designed to test your wits and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Ups:</strong> Discover and equip powerful items that give you new abilities, making you stronger and more versatile as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperative play:</strong> Share the adventure with friends, combining your strengths to overcome the most formidable obstacles and unlock every secret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Worlds:</strong> Explore and conquer each world to unlock the next, uncovering the mysteries of the multiverse one Loop at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Collect coins across different worlds and use them in the store to get a variety of skins. Mix and match to show off your unique style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513440/extras/9411d90fc4394a90c69af77a40cc70a4.poster.avif?t=1743429636\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_