    "short_description": "Get ready for an intergalactic adventure in eWorlds! After a crash, you\u2019re stuck on a tropical island. Grab the Loops to unlock the Space HUB, which will open up exciting worlds. Solve puzzles, dodge traps, and uncover mysteries, solo or with friends. Are you up for the legendary Golden Loop quest?",
